= 24 July 1974 — The airport confrontation

[+ cyprus_atilla1_briefing +]

Previous report: [+ cyprus_atilla1_last_text +]

- @historical: Historical: Promise not to seize the airport by force.
- @alternative: Alternative: Negotiate UN-supervised arrangements for the approaches and access.
- @pressure: Alternative: Maintain the demand for control, risking escalation.

